{{Term/Store|Bright-Chested Duck|Bright-Chested Ducks|Series, BotW, TotK|plural}} are recurring [[Creature]]s in {{TLoZ Series}}.{{Exp Game|BotW, TotK}}<ref>{{Cite|'''Bright-Chested Duck'''|Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref><ref>{{Cite|'''Bright-Chested Duck'''|Hyrule Compendium|TotK}}</ref>

==Characteristics==
==={{BotW|-}}===
{{Compendium/Extract|Bright-Chested Duck}}
Bright-Chested Ducks are common [[Bird]]s that can be found in small flocks in bodies of [[Water (Terrain)|Water]] throughout [[Hyrule|Hyrule Kingdom]].<ref>{{Cite Book|quote= |book= CaC |publisher= |page= 164}}</ref><ref name="Compendium">{{Cite|These birds can be found on waterfronts all over Hyrule. Their webbed feet make them excellent swimmers, and their long necks allow them to duck their heads underwater to find food. Their fatty meat is high quality. |Hyrule Compendium|BotW}}</ref> They spend most of their time in the Water, paddling with their webbed feet, and occasionally dive the fronts of their bodies underwater to feed.<ref name="Compendium"/> When startled, the flock will fly away. Their meat is very fatty, and is considered to be high-quality food.<ref name="Compendium"/> When killed, Bright-Chested Ducks drop a [[Raw Bird Drumstick]].

